WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
We can look straight at a scene and still miss something unexpected.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The classic gorilla experiment tested attention during a specific counting task.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later research showed that even knowing the trick does not reveal every surprise.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
This is evidence about perception, not proof that an audio product fixes attention.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Zen12 advertises short sessions in several listening styles. Compare its format and real terms.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the original studies, try the free routine, and decide without pressure.
